<title>DENMARK: Phoenix still backs Rieber bid.</title>
<headline>Phoenix still backs Rieber bid.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish roadbuilder Phoenix Contractors said on Friday that its recommendation in favour of a takeover bid by Norway's Rieber and Son was unaltered by Danish firm Icopal's plans to bid.</p>
</text>
